The '''Kraken Cove''' is a dungeon full of underground lakes located in [[Piscatoris]], south-west of the [[Piscatoris Fishing Colony]], housing [[waterfiend]]s, [[cave kraken]]s, and the [[Kraken]] boss. All of the creatures can only be killed while on a [[Slayer task]].

Players may enter without a Slayer task, but upon attacking any monster inside the dungeon, [[Lieve McCracken]] will stop them from doing so, stating that they are not assigned to kill them.

It is not possible to use a [[dwarf multicannon]] within this dungeon. If players attempt to place one, they will instead receive a chatbox message: {{mes|Lieve McCracken won't be happy if you set up a cannon here.}}

==Transportation==
{{Map|align=left|x=2278|y=3611|r=3|mtype=square|width=200|height=200|caption=The location of the Kraken Cove.}}
There are several ways to access the cove:
* The [[fairy ring]] code {{Fairycode|AKQ}} will bring the players just east of the Cove.
* Using a [[Piscatoris teleport]] scroll, or either the [[Western banner 3]] or [[Western banner 4|4]] to teleport the [[Piscatoris Fishing Colony]], and running south-west.
